      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[0].body
      value: Dodge out of range of incoming attacks
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[0].clip
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 32900000, guid: fd9f0a3cd09ae5c4c96e0dace594b141, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[1].body
      value: "Block incoming attacks.\n Blocks cause Posture Damage to the Player\nEnemies
        will normally block all attacks, causing you posture damage"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[1].clip
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 128951d25f028c3458f39cb1e699dae7, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[2].body
      value: 'Block just before the hit connects to PARRY

        Parrying causes
        posture damage to the opponent'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[2].clip
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 44aadd04803ab5c4e83c369458e6709e, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[3].body
      value: 'A to punch

        Move towards enemy + punch to use moving punch

        Punches
        count for 1 point'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[3].clip
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 1fd68cae93c72144f8b74a8305f32840, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[4].body
      value: 'Right after a parry, the Enemy is open to a quick punch.

        Kicks
        wont work here'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[4].clip
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7c256523c1610e24a819eb54509c9ac8, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[5].body
      value: "B to Kick\n forward + B to do a moving Kick\n Kicks awards you 2 points\n10
        points, or the highest points at the end of time, Wins"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[5].clip
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 9ddf0c195e5e2304d9aa9f1ad6e8d0bd, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[6].body
      value: 'When a character''s Posture damage meter is full, they get stunned
        and are completely open to all attacks.

        Stun enemies by parrying
        and filling their posture meter'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[7].body
      value: "If you are thrown out of bounds, you get a warning. \n2 warnings leads
        to a point deduction"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[8].body
      value: 'when cornered, and the Opponent THROWS A PUNCH, quickly tap Y to swap
        places with them .

        This only works against enemy punches, not their
        kicks


        All controls can be viewed in the Pause Menu '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pages.Array.data[0].title
      value: Dodge
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2547103942606094687, guid: 874e289d11e7d104aa343a83c5c46ad1, type: 3}
